<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\death_sound3.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "111" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>Her head had been cut off?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But what about her dying from the fall off the cliff?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Something didn't add up...<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"But it's true, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> had already fallen from the cliff. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Apparently that alone was a fatal injury... and still, her head had been cut off."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Did you see that, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"No way... The first to find her was </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">They say there was no blood at all on top of the cliff. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">So it wasn't that her head was cut off and then she was pushed. Apparently she was pushed, and then her head was cut off."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, what about the culprit? With a crime like that, the culprit has to be someone in the settlement, right!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"No, nobody was caught..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Why not!? What did the police say!? If they'd checked who didn't have an alibi at the time, they'd have found the culprit right away...!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Everyone had an alibi... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">At first, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> was seen by lots of people in the settlement, running off somewhere in tears. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">The first to find the body, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, was one of them too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">So they split up and went after </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... and then..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"You mean the body of someone who died from the fall had its head cut off?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah..."</STYLE><PG>
In other words, everyone had an alibi, and at first glance it was an accidental death, or a suicide.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But because her head had been cut off, it became a baffling murder case.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Hence, a curse.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Grandma</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> wanted it that way, so they didn't call the police. She never told me why, though."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"But that's..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I was first told it was murder about 4 years ago. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I've been thinking about it a lot since then... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Grandma</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> pulling strings behind the scenes and killing </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... I wondered if that's what happened... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"But...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\砂利を歩く.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "500" "0"}
{CHGVOL "VOICE" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
Just then, footsteps echoed toward us.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
It seemed either <STYLE ID="6">Erika-chan</STYLE> or <STYLE ID="7">Chiga-nee</STYLE> had arrived.<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="3">"............!!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But the one who appeared there was―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\bgm_semarikuru.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
A strange figure in red robes and a Noh mask, carrying a nata and a mace.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Who is this...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "環境音\渓流.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "800" "5000" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, no need to freak out. That's </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Huh...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The figure stared at us for a while, then walked over toward the gravestone.
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She didn't seem to mean us any harm.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"That scared me..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"By the way, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Grandma</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s gonna show up dressed like that too."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Come on... tell me things like that first..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花頭かく.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Sorry, sorry! Huh, so this stuff really is unique to Arata... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I didn't know that till recently..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Of course anyone would be startled by someone decked out with weapons and a Noh mask.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\砂利を歩く.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "500" "0"}
{CHGVOL "VOICE" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Then I heard another set of footsteps.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\大魔女手ぶら.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The person who appeared wore black robes and an old woman's Noh mask, different from <STYLE ID="7">Chiga-nee</STYLE>'s.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This one wasn't holding anything.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This one is supposedly <STYLE ID="6">Erika-chan</STYLE>, but it's still scary...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Here we go, it's starting. Make sure your phones won't make any noise."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ赤ストラップ入.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "C" "100" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
I took out my phone and checked that it was on silent mode.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Out this far, it seemed there was no signal at all.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "太古の暗い鳴動.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,人物2,アイテム1,アイテム2" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\大魔女能面横逆.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"Bem-vindo, novo bruxa." [TN: Portuguese in the original, kept as printed.]</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\墓場夜.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">Erika-chan</STYLE> spoke words in a language I couldn't place.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Yes, from the voice it was clearly <STYLE ID="6">Erika-chan</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\能面横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\能面土下座逆.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
Then <STYLE ID="7">Chiga-nee</STYLE> bowed deeply to <STYLE ID="6">Erika-chan</STYLE>.<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Vamos, Destrua a bruxa morta."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\大魔女手ぶら.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神ハンマー上げる.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
When <STYLE ID="6">Erika-chan</STYLE> chanted something, <STYLE ID="7">Chiga-nee</STYLE> turned toward the gravestone and swung the mace high overhead.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHGVOL "BGM" "700" "1000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\ジャンプ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神ハンマー振りおろし.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ハンマー衝突.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神ハンマー上げる.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\ジャンプ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神ハンマー振りおろし.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ハンマー衝突.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">Chiga-nee</STYLE> went on <STYLE ID="8" RUBY="たた">smashing</STYLE> the gravestone apart with the mace, without hesitation.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The sound of the stream was drowned out by the blows, and I could no longer hear it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I just watched as the gravestone was mercilessly smashed to pieces.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
―Eventually, the gravestone was reduced to something no different from the stones around it.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\大魔女手ぶら.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\墓場夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"Return, novo bruxa."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At <STYLE ID="6">Erika-chan</STYLE>'s command, <STYLE ID="7">Chiga-nee</STYLE> disappeared into the forest without looking our way.
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "環境音\渓流.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "700" "5000" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="6">Erika-chan</STYLE> watched her go, then walked over to us.
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\大魔女能面バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Whew. Done, done."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\swish.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカ大魔女バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
When she took off the Noh mask and hood, underneath was <STYLE ID="6">Erika-chan</STYLE>'s face, sweat beading on her forehead.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"This outfit really is hot. Maybe I'll switch to something a bit thinner."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Grandma</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, is this okay? You're not supposed to join up with us till we're home..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Well, let's not be so stiff about it!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花頭かく.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Geez... the </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">head of Arata</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> sure takes it easy..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Well, call it the changing times."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\すきま風の声.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\荒田森1夜.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―We got up and went back the way we'd come.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカ大魔女バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, you girls got to see something pretty rare, didn't you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"That thing... what does it mean?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"They say it means freeing the souls of the dead from under the ground and returning them to heaven. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Something about a great being sleeping underground."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"What </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Erika-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> was speaking earlier, um... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">was it Portuguese?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Oh! Just what I'd expect from a genius girl! That's right! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">　Seems a lot of the Arata settlement's ancestors were Westerners who fled here. Western culture's been worked into all sorts of rites. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">What I said earlier was simple stuff, like 'Destroy the gravestone' and 'Become a witch.'"</STYLE><PG>
I remembered what <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> had told us earlier.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When <STYLE ID="2">Sakura-san</STYLE> died, <STYLE ID="6">Erika-chan</STYLE> hadn't reported it to the police.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In other words, she covered the case up.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Grandma</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... it's about time you told me. What happened to </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"If you're bringing it up here, then </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> and the others must know too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Well, that's fine. I was planning to tell </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> and the others anyway."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She'd been planning to tell us?<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Once we get home, I'll change and come to the living room. Wait until then."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Okay..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
