A woman was looking our way, smiling.<PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\誰もいない校舎で.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"This is </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">. I think I heard this photo was taken on the way home from her high school graduation."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Her hair was a translucent brown, close to blond.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Clear-cut features.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Skin as white as pearl.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And both eyes blue.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Unlike <STYLE ID="7">Chiga-nee</STYLE> and her sister, <STYLE ID="2">Sakura-san</STYLE> didn't seem to have odd eyes.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"She's so beautiful. Right, she's </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s mom, after all."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"She looks like this, but she was Japanese through and through. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">There were lots of white people among the ancestors, so every so often somebody like her gets born, I hear."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A gentle smile, like glass.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even though it was only a photo, I felt like I'd be drawn into <STYLE ID="2">Sakura-san</STYLE>'s smile.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"They say this is the only one taken naturally, apart from posed commemorative photos. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> apparently hated how </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">she</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> looked..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Even though she's this pretty?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Seems lots of the girls at school were jealous of it. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">She got bullied because of her looks, which didn't seem Japanese. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> was timid, or rather, she was just too gentle and kind..."</STYLE><PG>
Bullied because of her beauty and her kind nature.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's so unfair. Just hearing about it makes me feel sick.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> died 10 years ago―on April 17, Shiyo 790. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">They say almost all the cherry blossoms in Arata had already fallen by then. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">From here on, I'll tell you what I actually saw in Arata when I was 7."</STYLE>
